<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">- NUMANA</book>
  <para style="toc1">1TI - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc2">1TI - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc3">1TI - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="mt1">1TI - NUMANA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Icɛr yiŋɛ irɛ bǝn nga Bulus, inǝ na ndum kɛ Kristi Yesɔ nǝ nek lɛ kɛ Arik nǝ ta ta zhɔk amɔr bǝn Kristi Yesɔ inǝ zhɔk susun amɔr<verse eid="1TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />Gar bǝn Timoti izu muŋ didik ne tanyɛme:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 1:2">Iki didik, ben ilɔ susun ben sik susun ire ben Arik tetɛɛ amɔr ben Kristi Yesɔ Ŋgɔŋ amɔr.<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ne gbaŋ aneshir atɔŋ ne atu abɛ tsar mu ne cɛr yi Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Bulus adi ir keŋ ndi Mnǝ blaa zhin ndi mne ngar Makidɔniya, izhin bǝ klɛ ne Afisa te di aneshir anuŋ amwɔ bɛ duŋ tsar lɛ kǝ mu <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />kǝr abɛ nek atu amen ne bla nga ŋli aneshir ndi ba yi ki didik ba. Ndi ina Gli antam gli nyɛmɛ te duŋ na ndum kɛ Arik, ndi ai tanyɛmɛ ne susun. <verse eid="1TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Iki zhɔk ne ti yi nek lɛ kǝŋe ayi tanyɛme ne akpa, ndi rɛ ne susun tsetser ben lɛ nǝ dur adidik ben itanyɛmɛ didik. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Aneshir anuŋ ne duŋ lɛ kǝŋe te kama zǝ lɛ kɛ sha. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />Awɔb te aba abɛ yi abɛ tsar icɛr yi Musa, ama ba zhi ki yiŋ ndi aba blai ba ben iki yiŋ ndi aba ne tanyɛmɛ neyi.<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />Ta ne zhi te ilɛ kǝ cɛr yi Musa irɛ ate yi ndi azǝ kǝ ir kǝŋ ndi iyimɛ. <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />Nǝ tǝ yi shuzhi, aye mɛ, tǝ nɛna lelɛ yi kpa nyak, ba yi abe aner tsetser ba, ama abǝ yaŋ zǝ lɛ kɛ Arik bǝn abǝ zhib, tǝ abǝ yaŋ zǝ Arik bǝn lalɛ, tǝ abaŋ ndi ba zǝ Arik ba kai izhu mimin, bǝn abaŋ ndi aŋlɔk atetɛ ka anǝya, ǝ abǝ ŋlɔk aner, <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />bǝn abǝ bubu tiŋ, bǝn abɛ kam vuu akpa mɛn kur ɔ, bǝn abɛ zhib aneshir, tǝ vuŋ abaŋ ndi ati mu tɛ ba kɔka abɛ na kinuŋ kaaŋ kaŋ nǝ lɛ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />Itsar yuŋɔ iyi nǝ lɛ didik kǝ men keŋ ndi agbar asak ne kǝ, lɛ didik kǝ men irɛ ngɔŋ bǝn ta anu adidik kɛ Arik.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus ne nyɛr Kristi Yesɔ ne nau iki didik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Mne nyɛr Kristi Yesɔ Ŋgɔŋ amɔr, waŋ ndi ne nǝm mgbyamgbyaŋ, ndi ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɛm, te hriam tem na ndum maa, <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />ndi amɛ nǝ kukub Mnǝ lɛ lǝlɛ mimin ne tu maa tǝ na sak iya bǝn tǝu mla. Ama Arik ne wɔ lɔ susun muŋ tǝ Mnǝ na amɛ ne yaŋ zhi muŋ bǝn yaŋ tanyɛmɛ. <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />Ina iki didik iyi Ŋgɔŋ amɔr ne bwa shur ne tu muŋ tetɛk, ben tanyɛme tena nyɛr ndi iyi ne miŋ kɛ Kristi Yesɔ.<verse eid="1TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Waŋa ayi lɛ didik ndi ne bla kɛ ndi abɛ tanyɛmɛ ne kɛ bɔbɔk: Kristi Yesɔ ne nyɛ gɔnmimi te bɛ ta abɛ na zumimin azhɔk, te nga Bulus ne yine na zumimin ngɔŋ ne miŋ mǝnɛ. <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />Ama ne yiŋɛ Arik ne lɔ susun muŋ, ne na zumimin ŋgon, Kristi Yesɔ tei tsar lɔ susun maa tetɛk ben abɛm te bǝ yi iki zǝ ben abaŋ ndi ate ta Yesɔ anyɛ me te aba bɛ yik vli kɛ yaŋ klɛ. <verse eid="1TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Azǝzaŋa Itum waŋ ndi ba yi ne klɛtu ba, waŋ ndi ba yi nǝ wu kpa ba, waŋ ndi ba yigu ba, ndi wa ayi Arik ankyak, iyik ngɔŋ maa bǝn gbar asak bǝ yi maa iyaŋ klɛtu. Bǝyi amɛ.<verse eid="1TI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Timoti, izu muŋ, me nǝgu lɛ keŋ ndi abɛ bla shar Arik ne bla kɛ ne atu mi kukub, utǝ zǝ kɛ utei tyak ikum iyi tyak didik, <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />bɛ gli tanyɛme mi anenen ne susun didik. Anuŋ ne kyak zǝ lɛ kɛ dur men te cok tanyɛmɛ men ala. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Nǝ miŋ mǝnɛ, Himinayas bǝn Askandari, abaŋ ndi Mnǝ baŋ ba sak shetan ne aŋɔk te bǝ tsar ba te kǝr abɛ lɛ ki mimin ne tu aye Arik ba.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Inǝk lɛ Bulus ne atu ayi zekuu Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Nǝ kuti bɔbɔk, fe, mdi te iwɔb, iben, zhin shur ben nyɛr bǝ yi ben aneshir bɔbɔk, <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />te atum bǝn bɔbɔk anuŋ ndi ayi angɔngɔŋ, tǝ ta bǝ sɔŋ isɔŋ kɛ sik susun te ta bǝ zǝ Arik nɛ asusun tsetser. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Ina amɛ irɛ, te na rɛ Arik waŋ ndi ne ta ta ashur, <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />ndi a wɔb te aneshir bɔbɔk abɛ lieru te bɛ na zhi lɛ didik kɛ Arik. <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Tǝ Arik wa ayi zhiin inǝ atsutsu izhiin ne angus akɛ Arik ben neshir, ayi wa Yesɔ Kristi, <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />waŋ ndi ne nǝk tu maa te abɛ ta aneshir ashur bɔbɔk. Iyiŋe ne na ne mkpaŋa anenen. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />Ne me ne hriam te mbǝ yi ne du lɛ kɛ Arik, bǝn ine na ndum kɛ Arik mbla lɛ didik bam timu ba, te ntsar abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba ilɛ didik.<verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Mǝ wɔb te alulum kɔte me abɛ ben Arik, te lɛk aŋɔk amen ayi yi tsetser ne shu, ne yaŋ te mfu ben nga aŋa.<verse eid="1TI 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />Mne na wɔb te amba abɛ duŋ anenen, ne ki didik iyi yaŋ nek ishisha, ben zi tu zhɔk ba iduŋ kɛ tsar luk tu, kɔ iduŋ kɛ tsar kiki iyi zinariya kɔ kiki iyi laŋ klaklak, kɔ tsar su kiki yi te anyaŋ ba, <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />ama amba abɛ tsǝntsǝn didik te na ki didik ndi amba abaŋ ndi a zǝ Arik.<verse eid="1TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Iwa abɛ yine wɔ tsar ne sɔŋ yaŋ lɛ ben yaŋ lɛk tu. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />Bam ne tanyɛmɛ te iwa abe tsar kɔ abe yi nǝ mgbyamgbyaŋ netu ayi lulum ba; abɛ yine ku anu. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Tǝ Arik ane kuti ana Ademu, te ashe na Awawu. <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />Shetan bane kuti alɔm Ademu ba, ne lɔm Awawu te duŋu yaŋ zǝ ilɛ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Fe amba atei lieru ne ŋli amumun ate tanyɛmɛ ne asusun amen, ne tanyɛme ne akpa, ne tsǝn tsetser ben vuŋ kpa Gli.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Abɛ mla na ndum kɛ Arik ne Akabaŋkɔŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Waŋa ayi bla ilɛ didik: Ate yi ndi nɛr awɔb gli aneshir abɛ zǝ Arik, awɔb ndum didik. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />Neme ngɔŋ ne gli aneshir ne Akabankɔŋ abɛ yi waŋ ndi ba anabu ivǝn ŋɔk ne atu ayi kinuŋ ba, abɛyi ner nǝ iwa zhiin, inǝ vuŋ kpa gli inǝ te sǝsǝk Arik, ine ta acɛn, be yi nǝ tsar; <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />ba yi ine sɔ ki rǝrǝ ba, ba ine te mfu andanda ba, abɛ yi inǝ shur kpa, ba ine wɔb vǝǝ ba, ba ine nyɛr azɔb ba. <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />Abɛ yi waŋ ndi agli ikɔ maa igligli ididik, tena Gli amumun amaa gligli ididik te duŋ ba azǝ lɛ maa ne ankɔŋ adidik. <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />Waŋ ndi bate zhi gli kɔmaa ba atei na kikin te zhi gli aner abɛ zǝ Arik? <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />Kǝr abɛ yi waŋ ndi atashe ata Arik ba, te kǝr abɛ lǝktu agli ne shu ba te azhaku ne ambuk ayiŋ ndi ne nyak shetan neyi. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />Abɛ nayi nǝ sak didik iwaŋ ndi abɛ yaŋ zǝ Arik alɛ lɛ kǝ rɛ ne atu amaa, te kǝr abɛ nabu ven ŋɔk ba, te kǝr abɛ zhaku nɛ atsǝtsaŋ ayi shetan ba.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Ne ankɔŋ azhiin awaŋa, abɛ lɔk na ndum ne akabankɔŋ, abɛ yi abǝ shur kpa, ba abǝ nunu yaa ba, kɔ abɛ sɔ ki rǝrǝ, kɔ abɛ wɔb kiki iyi yaŋ ne men tetɛk, <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />abɛ yi abaŋ ndi agli lɛ kǝ zub nǝ tanyɛmɛ iyi dur tsetser. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Abɛ tsar ba tɔ neliŋ, fɛna, atɛ lieru nǝ tsaraa, atei yi abǝ na ndum ne akabankɔŋ.<verse eid="1TI 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Amba mǝnɛ mɛnyi bɛ yi nɛ asusun adidik tǝ kǝr abɛ na yi abǝ ter aneshir ba; abɛ yi amba abaŋ ndi avuŋ kpa agli bǝn lɛ didik, abɛ yi amba abaŋ ndi ashur kpa ne kɔte nii.<verse eid="1TI 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Inǝ lɔk ne ndum ne akabankɔŋ abɛ nak ayi waŋ ndi ayine iwa zhiin ankyak te nau iki didik te gli amumun amaa agli gli didik ben nki aner kɔb maa. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Abaŋ ndi ne na ndum na didik, ne wɔb atu amen asak didik, atei ta ba ta ta didik ne tanyɛme ne sak kɛ Kristi Yesɔ.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Ndi M cɛru mplɛ kǝŋe, M zhɔk susun tǝm nyɛ tǝna yigu andanda. <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />Ama ate yi ndi Mtei mbaŋ mkpaŋ, mplɛ kǝ cɛr kǝŋe tei duŋu zhi irkǝŋ ndi tabǝ tsǝn nǝ nkɔŋ kǝ aner abǝ zǝ Arik, ik nyɛ azizaŋa ba, utei zhi ir sɔŋ kǝŋ ndi utei sɔŋ bǝn abǝ zǝ Arik, ikǝŋ ndi yɛ akabankɔŋ ayɔu Arik tsitsir, itanda kǝ zhik nǝ zub. <verse eid="1TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />Inuŋ ba tei tun irkǝŋ ndi isuyir ngɔŋ yi zǝ Arik mɔr: Yesɔ nɛ munɔru nǝ kpa kǝ neshir, nɛ tsaru tǝ abe yi didik nǝ Izhu tsetser, bǝn abǝ shar ayou Arik nɛ yigu. Nɛ du lɛ maa nǝ ntuntun, nɛ tanyɛmɛ bǝne bɔu nǝ gɔŋmimi, tɛna baŋu tɛ kɔmɔ nǝ gbarshu.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s">Inǝk Timoti ilɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Izhu tsetser ne bla tedi, mkpaŋ tei nyɛ anuŋ atei duŋ tanyɛmɛ ne asusun amen te zǝ anerim abɛ timu, ben tsar yi mu. <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />Itsar yi timu yiŋɛ ire ben abǝ na iyik ayi iyi mu, ndi idur mǝne neka te ndi ne goŋǝ ne adagi. <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />Aba ayar aneshir ta amba ben li kiki yi li nuŋ, ndi Arik ne nai te bɛ tei ne nyɛr ben abɛ baŋ ndi ne tanyɛmɛ tena zhi lɛ kǝ zub. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Iki yiŋ ndi Arik ne nai irɛ, amɛ kǝr abɛ kyak kinuŋ ba te yi ndi ne tei ne nyɛr, <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />te neka duŋǝ iyi tsetser ne lɛ kɛ Arik bǝn iben.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nǝ na ndum Kristi Yesɔ didik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Te yi ndi utǝ bla abǝ zǝ Arik lɛ kǝŋe utei yi gɛn didik nǝ na ndum kǝ Kristi Yesɔ, waŋ ndi ne te ngɔŋ ne lɛ kɛ Arik ne tsar lɛ ma didik ikeŋ ndi uzǝ kɛ. <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Kǝr ubǝ zǝ lǝlɛ yi sha bǝn yiŋ ndi ba tei duŋu flu ne lɛ kɛ Arik ba, ne me ubǝ vuŋ kpa mi gli te zǝ Arik. <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />Ina ndum kɛ var azhizhi ne kpa inǝk iki didik ne kpa, ize Arik inǝk ki didik ne kɔte ni, te yi ki kpa nyak yi nek vli kɛ azizaŋa ben gar ti.<verse eid="1TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Ilɛ kǝŋe iyi lɛ didik, irɛ te abɛ takɛ bɔbɔk <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />ne lɛ kǝŋe ta yik iya, te yaŋ li tǝ ta ne zhɔk susun bǝn Arik amɔr ndi ayi tsitsir, waŋ ndi ayi wa ne ta aneshir ashur bɔbɔk, ne tu abaŋ ndi ne tanyɛmɛ ne lɛ kɛ Arik.<verse eid="1TI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />Be nek lɛ te na tsar kiki yiŋɛ. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Timoti kǝr ubǝ duŋ nuŋ ayaŋ tɔu ashak ayi ba tɛ yik tǝ uyi vǝvǝn vǝtsɔb, ama ubɛ yi abɛ zǝ Arik iki tɔ, ne lɛ mi, ne tsǝn mi, bǝn kiki yi na mi, bǝn Nyɛr, tanyɛmɛ bǝn tsetser. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Iŋub mkpaŋ kǝ nyɛ muŋ, ubǝ nǝk itu mi nǝ bla aneshir lɛ kɛ Arik, ubǝ du kɛ tǝna tsar ba ne kǝ. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />Kǝr ubǝ duŋ zhi yiŋ ndi Arik nɛ nǝgu neyi ba, ndi nɛ nǝgu neyi ne bla yi ti, ndi angɔngɔŋ abǝ gli amkpa anǝ ben Arik nɛ sagu aŋɔk amɛn.<verse eid="1TI 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Ubɛ yi mgbemgbebɛ ne kiyiŋɛ, ubǝ nek tu mi bɔbɔk ne kiki yiŋɛ te kɔte ŋɔwa atei yik iliti mi. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Ubɛ nak tɔ tsǝn mi ben tsar mi. Ubǝ zǝ lɛ kɛ tsar mi, utǝ na amɛ utei ta tu mi zhɔk bǝn abaŋ ndi awɔ lɛ kǝ tsar mi.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="s1">Inǝk lɛ netu Ambakɔ, Anuŋkub ben Agɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />Duŋ gbaŋ cicɛ neshir atɔŋ nǝ kɔr kɛ tsaŋ ba, ama ubǝ zhɔk kɔr te lɛ bǝne bɔu ndi tetɛ nǝ ŋliu. gli amun anzak bwe ndi ayi amunzumen, <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />acicɛ amba ndi aneyaa, ben asun amba ndi amunva, te bɛ yi tsetser.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Tɔ ambakɔ shak ayi abaŋ ndi ayik iyah. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Ama atei ndi iwakɔ mɔ ayi ne amumun kɔ alɛla, iki yi kuti na men abɛ zǝ ankɔŋ ayou Arik ne gli aner kɔb men tena na abaŋ ndi ne ŋli ba ben atsintsim amen iki didik, te waŋa ai nyɛr Arik. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Iwakɔ waŋ ndi ayi kiki maa, ndi ba azɔgu nǝ kinuŋ ba, nɛ zhɔk susun amaa bǝn Arik tɛna ben Arik ibu bǝn aririk te bɛ nǝgu iki yi wɔb maa. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Ama ate yi ndi iwakɔ waŋ ndi awɔb men kɛ sɔŋ gɔŋmimi nɛ ku kɔ atɛ yi tsitsir. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Nǝk aneshir lǝlɛ yiŋɛ, aba imen yi, te kǝr nuŋ abɛ na iki yiŋ ndi kǝr abɛ nyaŋu lalɛ ba. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Ate yi ŋdi inuŋ ba nǝk aner amaa ikinuŋ yi li ba, didik ngoŋ kɔmaa kɛ gbahir, ne tun ta nyɛmɛ te na mimin anaŋ ne yaŋ zǝ Arik.<verse eid="1TI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Ba kɔte wakɔ tawa ai blau azhɔk ne miŋ kɛ ambakɔ ba se ne kam ase sɔk tani, tena klɛ mgbamgbaŋ ndi ne ŋa lulum zhin, <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />fe nena zhiu ne ki didik yi na maa, ne gar kɛ gli amumun amaa, azhi ta acɛn, aŋlaa abɛ yi tsetser mgbumgbuk ye aza, te naa abɛ yik iyah ki didik tena nek tu maa ne amkpa ane na kiki iyi rɛ.<verse eid="1TI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Atei asun ambakɔ, duŋ shur ba ne nkɔŋ kǝŋe ba. Tǝ ikpa mǝne te lu klɛ kɛ wɔb lulum ba atei nek Kristi atu amen ba, atei di aba awɔb ŋa, <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />fe atei te atu amen ambuk, te ne glak ikpa anu men yi kuti. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />Nɛ na wɔb sɔŋ ikɛ sha iyaŋ na kinuŋ nǝ zǝn zǝ akɔkɔb; fena imimin ngɔŋɔ, tǝ vuŋ tɛr anuŋ bǝn kyak sɔŋ amkpa zhiin, te bla nkan lǝlɛ yiŋ ndi bane iyi bla ba. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Fe mnǝk ambakɔ ndi ari yi asun amba lɛ tǝ bɛ gar ŋa, te ŋli amumun, te gli akɔb amen tena kyak nek shetan ankɔŋ ane fir yir ba. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Anuŋ neka mǝne kam agɔŋ te kama zǝ ishetan.<verse eid="1TI 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Atei ndi iwa nuŋ ayi ne zǝ Arik te ambakɔ ayi ne kɔmaa, abɛ nek ba ki ndi awɔbǝ kǝr abɛ duŋ yi ihru te abɛ zǝ Kristi tetɛk ne atu mǝne ba, te duŋ abɛ zǝ Kristi abɛ ka zɔk ambakɔ abaŋ ndi ase mǝne ne te ayi sɔŋ yaŋ alulum.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Angɔŋgɔŋ abaŋ ndi ana ndum kɛ Arik ne ankɔŋ adidik ne te tǝ bɛ nek ba ki ntǝk yaa, didik ngɔŋ abaŋ ndi ana du lɛ kɛ Arik tena tsar. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Tǝ ilɛ kɛ Arik di, &lt;&lt;Duŋ di utei ku anu alandɔŋ nǝ mkpaŋ keŋ ndi azǝn jaŋ Arik,&gt;&gt; fena &lt;&lt;Ine na ndum ne te tǝ bɛ ta idǝk maa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1TI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />Duŋ ta iter ye aneshir netu ayi cice neshir ba se aner amɛ yaa kɔ amɛ atar ate na yik. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />Abaŋ ndi ate lalɛ abɛ gbaŋ ba atɔŋ ne ayi aneshir, te duŋ anuŋ abɛ te sǝsǝk.<verse eid="1TI 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />Nǝ ti kɛ Arik bǝn Kristi Yesɔ bǝn abɛ shar Arik M zhɔ zhin tǝ izhin bɛ gli nkan lǝlɛ yiŋɛ nǝ yaŋ nyɛr tu, tena duŋ naki kasaŋkaŋ.<verse eid="1TI 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />Duŋ nama asak aneshir aŋɔk tǝ abɛ naa Arik ndum ba. Duŋ biŋ tu bǝn kiki zumimin iyi na anuŋ ba; gli kpami tsetser.<verse eid="1TI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Duŋ so amashir ashishir ankyak ba, fena yiŋ sɔ ave amashir arǝrǝ netu ayi nnɛ mi ben sa kpami.<verse eid="1TI 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Ilalɛ ye aner anuŋ ayige ndende, ikuti la lɛme nǝ tǝ yir amkpa anǝ te ambuk; iyi anuŋ ize ba ne gɔŋ. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Iyi anenen, iki didik ayige ne abɛm, fena kɔ abaŋ ndi ba yik mǝne ba batei suyir ba.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Abaŋ ndi ayi agɛn abe nǝk atukɔ amen bɔbɔk ngɔŋ mɛn, tǝ duŋ kǝr nuŋ abe le lɛ mimin nǝ sak kɛ Arik bǝn tsar mɔr ba. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Agɛn abaŋ ndi atukɔ amǝnɛ aye bǝ zǝ Kristi kǝr abɛ yaŋ tɔ ba shak ayi ba, te aye abǝ zǝ Arik mɛn yi. Ndi amɛ, abɛ naa ba ki didik, tǝ abaŋ ndi ayik mɛn kɛ ndum mǝnɛ kǝ nyɛr mɛn.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1TI 6:2">Nyɛr azɔb</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">Waŋ ai kiki ndi utei tsar te duŋ ba zhi.<verse eid="1TI 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Ate yi ndi inuŋ atsar lɛ kɛ timu tena kyak tanyɛmɛ ne lɛ didik kɛ Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi bǝn tsar lɛ didik, <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />neshire alǝk tu te bane zhi kinuŋ ba. Ayi ne nkan lɛ yi yaŋ rɛ nenu amaa tena vǝ ne tu ayi mwɔ nkan lǝlɛ yi duŋ ate ankiŋki, iwɔ bɔ akla, bǝn cɔk sak la, <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />tǝ na nyɛr tǝ antam bǝn abaŋ ndi asusun amǝnɛ ne ta nyɛmɛ ne lǝlɛ yi sha, abaŋ neka kam ti ne bla zub tena yik ize Arik aye ankɔŋ ane wɔb adudunki yi gɔŋmimi. <verse eid="1TI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Ama ize Arik bǝn iki yiŋ ndi iyi mi inǝk sik susun. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Tǝ bata ne gli kinuŋ te nyɛ gɔŋmimi ba, fe bata tei na baŋ kinuŋ ne gɔŋmimi te ŋurkam ba. <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Fena, ate yi ndi tayi nǝ kili bǝn kiyi su, ta tei nyɛr ne kime. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Aner abaŋ ndi awɔb adudunki azhaku ne agyaŋ bǝn kiki tetɛk iyi sha bǝn iyi bubu ndi lɔm ba cɔk la tena shur ba adɔmɔ. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Tǝ nyɛr azɔb iye ankɔŋ ane na kiki mimin. Aner anuŋ, ne su ayi ne wɔb azɔb, tǝ nɛ dur ne ankɔŋ ane tanyɛmɛ te gbaaŋ atu amen ilaŋ asusun.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus nɛ nǝk Timoti ilɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Fe iwa, iner ayɔu Arik, tǝ shaan nǝ kiki yiŋe bɔbɔk. Tsǝ kli nɛ na didik, izǝ Arik, tanyɛmɛ, nyɛr, ivuŋkpa, bɛn iyaŋ zaŋ. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />Klu klu didik nǝ min klu kǝ tanyɛmɛ, tɛ ta tu anku kǝ vli kǝ yaŋ klɛ imi; tǝ nǝ vli kǝŋe ndi Arik nɛ zhɔu klik nǝ tanyɛmɛ mi neyi aner tǝtɛk. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />Nǝ ti kɛ Arik, waŋ ndi anǝk vli ne kɔte nii, bǝn Kristi Yesɔ, iwaŋ ndi atei sak ilɛmɛ ne ti kɛ Buntu Bilatus ne tanyɛmɛ didige, ai ŋgam diu <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />te zǝ nkanlɛ yiŋɛ kǝr kinuŋ bǝ cɔgǝ la ba kɔ nǝk lalɛ ba se mkpaŋ keŋ ndi Ŋgɔŋ amɔr Yesɔ Kristi ne munɔru. <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />Imunru maa itei gli mkpaŋ didik kɛ Arik, inǝ anu adidik bǝn inǝ gli aneshir kiki maa, Itum anɛ tum bǝn Ŋgɔŋ anɛ angɔŋgɔŋ, <verse eid="1TI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />Yesɔ wa kiki maa ba yi nǝ kpa kɛ bɔ; asɔŋ nɛ amkpa anǝ laŋ ndi ba garu ayir ba. Inuŋ bane zǝne yigu ba; inuŋ ba tei na yigu ba. Inǝk ngɔŋ bǝ yi maa bǝn mgbyamgbyaŋ kǝ yaŋ klɛtu! Bǝ yɛmɛ.<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Di abaŋ ndi ayi nɛ adudunki nǝ gɔŋmimi kɛ azǝzaŋa kǝr abɛ ŋur asa ba, ama abɛ nyak susun, banǝ susun kɛ adudunki ba, fɛ abɛ zhɔk susun ne zǝ Arik, iwa ndi ayi ne nǝk ta kɔte nii yi nyɛr mɔr. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Di ba abɛ na ki didik, tǝ abɛ yi abǝ adudunki ne ankɔŋ adidik, bǝn bu aŋɔk tǝna yi abɛ gab ki ndi ayimɛ nɛyi bǝn anuŋ. <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />Nǝ yiŋɛ atei biŋ atu amen adudunki ayiŋ ndi itei yi tanda kǝ nyɛ nǝ ti. Tǝ duŋ ba abɛ baŋ susun keŋ ndi iyi susun kɛ yaŋ ku. <verse eid="1TI 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Timoti, gli ki yiŋ ndi nɛ nǝgu neyi mgbamgbaŋ. Tǝ shan bǝn abǝ bla lǝlɛ yi sha bǝn tǝ antam ayiŋ ndi anuŋ azhɔi tǝ &lt;&lt;Mgbemgbeb.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />Tɛ anuŋ awun ashaga tɛ aba yimɛ nekǝ, ndi nɛ na mɛ te dur nǝ tanyɛmɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Ita zhɔk yɛ Arik bǝ yi bǝn zhin bɔbɔk.<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>